WEBVTT

00:00:00.570 --> 00:00:02.050
Reiji!

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:05.370
Hey!

00:00:05.370 --> 00:00:06.790
We'll finish this another time.

00:00:07.420 --> 00:00:08.990
Wait!

00:00:08.990 --> 00:00:10.910
What's your name?

00:00:13.770 --> 00:00:15.960
Reiji Akaba.

00:00:22.530 --> 00:00:24.760
He was incredible.

00:00:24.760 --> 00:00:27.320
I can't believe he used Pendulum.

00:00:30.010 --> 00:00:30.960
Yuya!

00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:32.280
Yuya!

00:00:34.210 --> 00:00:36.480
Why could he Pendulum?

00:00:37.280 --> 00:00:40.890
I thought Pendulum Summon 
only belonged to me.

00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:43.840
Yuya...

00:00:44.260 --> 00:00:47.720
Well, it all turned out okay.

00:00:47.720 --> 00:00:49.120
Okay?

00:00:49.120 --> 00:00:51.760
Yeah.  LDS left.

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.400
Thanks to everyone's hard work, we 
were able to protect the school.

00:00:56.400 --> 00:01:00.600
You say "everyone," but Yuya 
was the only one who won.

00:01:02.640 --> 00:01:05.520
You didn't duel, so you can't comment!

00:01:05.520 --> 00:01:06.880
Yeah, you coward!

00:01:06.880 --> 00:01:09.080
You don't belong in You Show School!

00:01:09.240 --> 00:01:11.280
Yeah yeah, sorry.

00:01:12.920 --> 00:01:15.080
Where are you going, Sora?

00:01:15.080 --> 00:01:17.440
You shouldn't say things like that!

00:01:17.440 --> 00:01:19.480
Forget him!

00:01:19.480 --> 00:01:21.800
We don't need cowards!

00:01:21.800 --> 00:01:26.200
The next time LDS invades, I'll battle!

00:01:26.200 --> 00:01:26.840
Me too!

00:01:26.840 --> 00:01:27.720
And me!

00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:32.400
Use your Pendulum Summon to train us again!

00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:35.070
I'm not the only one who 
can Pendulum anymore!

00:01:41.760 --> 00:01:43.920
Where do you think you're going?

00:01:43.920 --> 00:01:46.200
Running away won't change the truth.

00:01:46.200 --> 00:01:51.880
Like you said, you're not the only 
one who can Pendulum Summon anymore.

00:01:54.590 --> 00:02:00.230
Implementing mass into Solid 
Vision has created Action Duels.

00:02:00.230 --> 00:02:08.410
In duels where the field, monsters and duelists 
become one, the people are caught in a frenzy of excitement!

00:02:09.790 --> 00:02:12.410
Believe x Believe  Biri-Biri-Biri Buddies!

00:02:28.100 --> 00:02:31.190
You!  The strongest card 
isn't about winning or losing

00:02:31.510 --> 00:02:34.600
You!  At full speed  On the game

00:02:41.660 --> 00:02:43.340
Swinging ma ma ma mind

00:02:43.340 --> 00:02:47.910
The soul's pendulum  Ultimate confusion

00:02:48.460 --> 00:02:50.110
Impulse  Got it got it

00:02:50.110 --> 00:02:55.320
Tough battles  Real revolution

00:03:01.680 --> 00:03:06.080
Everybody goin'  Break through the walls!

00:03:08.300 --> 00:03:13.000
Infinite future  Get rid of indecision!

00:03:13.690 --> 00:03:16.940
Make it Make it  Be courageous (Break it now)

00:03:16.940 --> 00:03:20.340
Step ahead!  Take a step (Do it now)

00:03:20.340 --> 00:03:30.620
The fun is only getting started!  
So everyone's a Believer!!

00:03:30.940 --> 00:03:33.960
Believe x Believe  Biri-Biri-Biri Buddies!

00:03:38.130 --> 00:03:44.000
Hot-Blooded!!  Shuzo Theater

00:03:44.830 --> 00:03:47.610
Welcome back, President.

00:03:50.510 --> 00:03:53.590
Give me the details on the attack on Marco.

00:03:53.860 --> 00:03:55.070
Yes.

00:03:55.070 --> 00:03:59.150
It occurred in Maiami 
City's NLD-038 District.

00:04:00.710 --> 00:04:03.390
It occurred at 5:54 pm.

00:04:03.390 --> 00:04:06.230
We detected a powerful summon.

00:04:06.230 --> 00:04:08.030
What was the summoning method?

00:04:08.030 --> 00:04:09.470
Xyz.

00:04:09.470 --> 00:04:13.150
We were with Yuya Sakaki at that time.

00:04:13.150 --> 00:04:17.910
And he doesn't have the 
knowledge or power to use Xyz.

00:04:18.430 --> 00:04:21.800
It's clear that Yuya 
Sakaki isn't the culprit.

00:04:21.800 --> 00:04:24.750
Nakajima, where is Marco?

00:04:24.750 --> 00:04:28.950
We haven't established that yet.  However...

00:04:29.710 --> 00:04:31.750
Chief, bring the item.

00:04:31.990 --> 00:04:32.790
Right.

00:04:33.190 --> 00:04:35.120
It was at the crime scene.

00:04:35.550 --> 00:04:39.520
The first team who arrived found it.

00:04:39.520 --> 00:04:42.910
It's badly damaged, but it 
definitely belongs to Marco.

00:04:43.550 --> 00:04:48.270
Keep using all of LDS's 
capabilities to find Marco.

00:04:48.270 --> 00:04:49.150
Understood!

00:04:50.550 --> 00:04:53.270
If he's fine, why won't they let me see him?

00:04:53.590 --> 00:04:57.550
Professor Marco will be happy to see me!

00:04:57.550 --> 00:05:02.750
Maybe he doesn't want to meet anyone because 
he's wrapped up in bandages like Sawatari.

00:05:02.750 --> 00:05:04.910
Don't compare him to that loser!

00:05:04.910 --> 00:05:09.950
How could he be hurt in a duel when 
it wasn't on an Action Duel Field?

00:05:09.950 --> 00:05:12.110
Where are you going?

00:05:12.110 --> 00:05:14.560
To find the truth, of course!

00:05:15.510 --> 00:05:22.270
You thought you were the only one who had Pendulum 
Cards, but there's someone else who can use them now.

00:05:22.270 --> 00:05:24.430
So you're in shock.

00:05:25.710 --> 00:05:29.950
I don't know how Reiji Akaba 
acquired Pendulum Cards.

00:05:29.950 --> 00:05:33.510
Maybe his company created them.

00:05:34.030 --> 00:05:35.350
Company?

00:05:35.350 --> 00:05:38.150
Reiji Akaba is Leo Corporation's president.

00:05:38.150 --> 00:05:42.240
His company has the world's 
#1 share in duel systems.

00:05:42.240 --> 00:05:47.490
It may be easy for them to unlock 
the secret of Pendulum Cards.

00:05:47.750 --> 00:05:52.070
That means the world will be full 
of Pendulum Cards eventually.

00:05:54.310 --> 00:05:56.150
Yuya!

00:05:57.510 --> 00:06:00.110
Duel me right now!

00:06:00.110 --> 00:06:05.590
My hot-blooded guidance will 
fix your pessimistic nature!

00:06:05.590 --> 00:06:08.230
What are you talking about, Dad?

00:06:08.910 --> 00:06:11.710
That's why you couldn't defeat Reiji Akaba!

00:06:11.710 --> 00:06:13.190
Duel me right now!

00:06:13.190 --> 00:06:15.310
Yuya won the first match!

00:06:15.310 --> 00:06:17.990
I'm the one who lost, so be mad at me!

00:06:17.990 --> 00:06:19.550
Don't interfere.

00:06:19.550 --> 00:06:21.030
Gongenzaka...

00:06:21.190 --> 00:06:24.550
The principal is challenging 
Yuya to a serious battle.

00:06:24.550 --> 00:06:27.710
I can tell by looking at his eyes.

00:06:28.470 --> 00:06:29.990
No way...

00:06:32.230 --> 00:06:33.470
Hey!

00:06:37.880 --> 00:06:40.790
I haven't agreed to this match!

00:06:41.870 --> 00:06:44.070
Is everything ready, Gongenzaka?

00:06:44.070 --> 00:06:45.050
Yeah!

00:06:45.050 --> 00:06:47.150
I haven't said yes!

00:06:47.150 --> 00:06:49.350
Start it up, Gongenzaka!

00:06:50.160 --> 00:06:53.730
Action Field on!

00:06:53.730 --> 00:06:57.710
I activate the Field Spell Showtime Street!

00:07:09.220 --> 00:07:09.990
Wow!

00:07:09.990 --> 00:07:11.190
It's beautiful!

00:07:12.350 --> 00:07:14.810
Can this be?

00:07:14.810 --> 00:07:16.350
Is this my Dad's?

00:07:16.350 --> 00:07:17.600
That's right!

00:07:17.600 --> 00:07:22.710
Your father Yusyo Sakaki was an expert 
on this Showtime Street field.

00:07:22.710 --> 00:07:27.990
I'll show you real entertainment 
dueling in his place!

00:07:27.990 --> 00:07:30.430
You think my dueling is fake?

00:07:30.430 --> 00:07:33.030
Compared to him, it's day and night!

00:07:33.030 --> 00:07:35.030
Even compared to me!

00:07:35.590 --> 00:07:37.200
Then I'll do it!

00:07:45.910 --> 00:07:49.190
The duelists meet at the battlefield!

00:07:49.190 --> 00:07:52.680
Along with their monsters, they'll kick 
the ground and fly through the sky...

00:07:52.680 --> 00:07:53.820
...to move...

00:07:53.990 --> 00:07:55.190
...around the field!

00:07:55.190 --> 00:07:58.560
Witness dueling's greatest evolution!

00:07:58.560 --> 00:08:00.470
Action!

00:08:00.470 --> 00:08:01.710
Duel!

00:08:05.500 --> 00:08:07.350
I'll go first!

00:08:07.350 --> 00:08:08.760
My turn!

00:08:08.760 --> 00:08:11.900
I summon Gutsmaster Fire from my hand!

00:08:15.040 --> 00:08:18.280
Gutsmaster Fire's effect activates!

00:08:18.520 --> 00:08:22.470
Once per turn, I can Special 
Summon a Gutsmaster from my hand.

00:08:22.470 --> 00:08:25.780
I Special Summon Gutsmaster Heat!

00:08:28.230 --> 00:08:31.620
Gutsmaster Heat's effect activates!

00:08:31.620 --> 00:08:35.350
Once per turn, I can Special 
Summon a Gutsmaster from my hand!

00:08:35.350 --> 00:08:38.200
I summon Gutsmaster Red!

00:08:39.500 --> 00:08:42.270
Hot-blooded monsters on Showtime Street?

00:08:42.270 --> 00:08:43.910
That don't belong here.

00:08:43.910 --> 00:08:45.750
They're too intense.

00:08:45.750 --> 00:08:49.710
The principal's monsters are 
full of fighting spirit!

00:08:49.710 --> 00:08:52.790
I set two cards and end my turn!

00:08:52.790 --> 00:08:54.830
Bring it on, Yuya!

00:08:55.350 --> 00:08:56.630
My turn!

00:08:56.630 --> 00:08:57.620
I draw!

00:08:57.830 --> 00:09:01.190
I activate the Continuous 
Trap Full Throttle Soul!

00:09:01.890 --> 00:09:05.350
I can activate it when 
Gutsmaster is on the field.

00:09:05.350 --> 00:09:08.630
We both have to reveal our hands.

00:09:09.110 --> 00:09:10.060
What?

00:09:10.060 --> 00:09:14.950
He said both, but only 
Yuya's hand was revealed.

00:09:14.950 --> 00:09:16.190
Look closely.

00:09:16.540 --> 00:09:18.910
The principal has no cards in his hand.

00:09:18.910 --> 00:09:20.170
You're right!

00:09:20.340 --> 00:09:21.440
I see!

00:09:21.440 --> 00:09:23.510
That's why he set all his cards.

00:09:23.510 --> 00:09:27.990
Hey, you have Stargazer and Timegazer!

00:09:27.990 --> 00:09:30.540
That means you'll definitely Pendulum, right?

00:09:30.540 --> 00:09:31.640
Bring it on!

00:09:32.040 --> 00:09:33.790
Or won't you?

00:09:33.790 --> 00:09:38.840
Maybe you can't use it because you're afraid 
of being compared to Reiji Akaba's Pendulum.

00:09:39.490 --> 00:09:42.030
Yuya is a loser.

00:09:42.030 --> 00:09:44.790
How horrible!  How dare he say that!

00:09:44.790 --> 00:09:46.240
You're the worst!

00:09:47.690 --> 00:09:50.840
I summon Performapal Friendonkey!

00:09:53.340 --> 00:10:00.250
When it's summoned, I can Special Summon one 
Level 4-or-below Performapal from my hand!

00:10:01.240 --> 00:10:04.740
I summon Performapal Whip Snake!

00:10:04.740 --> 00:10:09.140
Oh, you're really not going to Pendulum?

00:10:09.140 --> 00:10:12.020
Be quiet!  Battle, Friendonkey!

00:10:12.020 --> 00:10:14.290
Attack Gutsmaster Red!

00:10:16.290 --> 00:10:19.590
Gutsmaster Fire's effect activates!

00:10:19.590 --> 00:10:26.190
Once per turn, a different Gutsmaster in 
attack position can't be destroyed in battle.

00:10:33.740 --> 00:10:36.990
Gutsmaster Heat's effect activates!

00:10:36.990 --> 00:10:43.740
Once per turn, when a Gutsmaster in attack 
position battles, your monster is destroyed!

00:10:47.540 --> 00:10:49.790
Yuya's monster...

00:10:49.790 --> 00:10:51.100
...was destroyed!

00:10:52.140 --> 00:10:55.290
An impressive three-monster combo.

00:10:55.290 --> 00:10:56.840
Those are the skills of a pro!

00:10:56.840 --> 00:10:58.340
What are you talking about?

00:10:58.340 --> 00:11:00.640
This was only the beginning!

00:11:06.410 --> 00:11:07.590
Damn!

00:11:07.590 --> 00:11:10.040
But I still have Whip Snake!

00:11:10.040 --> 00:11:11.740
Battle, Whip Snake!

00:11:11.740 --> 00:11:14.120
Attack Gutsmaster Red!

00:11:15.240 --> 00:11:20.090
Shall I demonstrate real 
entertainment dueling?

00:11:20.340 --> 00:11:23.830
I activate the Action Spell Illusion Dance!

00:11:27.790 --> 00:11:32.240
All monsters on the field 
switch to defense position.

00:11:35.940 --> 00:11:38.440
If everyone is in defense position...

00:11:38.440 --> 00:11:40.680
...the attack won't be completed.

00:11:41.880 --> 00:11:44.790
That's right!  Dance!

00:11:44.790 --> 00:11:51.860
This is the real Yusyo Sakaki-style Action 
Duel that brings smiles to everyone's faces!

00:11:51.860 --> 00:11:55.440
Dad, you're getting carried away!

00:11:55.440 --> 00:11:59.830
Shuzo is socially awkward like always.

00:11:59.990 --> 00:12:01.240
Mrs. Sakaki!

00:12:01.240 --> 00:12:05.560
My husband would've gotten 
the message across better.

00:12:05.560 --> 00:12:07.840
What message?

00:12:13.450 --> 00:12:16.690
I end my turn!

00:12:16.690 --> 00:12:24.220
Illusion Dance's effect now ends, so all 
monsters change back from defense to attack position!

00:12:27.290 --> 00:12:30.440
That was my dad's Action Duel?

00:12:30.440 --> 00:12:34.240
My dad's was more amazing and cool!

00:12:34.240 --> 00:12:35.490
Exactly!

00:12:35.490 --> 00:12:40.740
Yusyo Sakaki was a more amazing 
and cool entertainer than anyone!

00:12:40.740 --> 00:12:44.490
But he wasn't like that in the beginning.

00:12:45.310 --> 00:12:50.040
Yusyo Sakaki brought thrills 
and speed to Action Duels.

00:12:50.040 --> 00:12:55.590
But his acrobatic dueling style 
brought lots of criticism.

00:12:58.640 --> 00:13:02.880
However, the jeers eventually 
turned into cheers.

00:13:03.520 --> 00:13:09.740
Yusyo Sakaki became a true shining 
star in the world of Action Duels!

00:13:10.440 --> 00:13:15.590
A door to a new future won't open until 
someone has the courage to push it open!

00:13:15.590 --> 00:13:20.280
Yuya, you opened a new door called Pendulum!

00:13:20.490 --> 00:13:24.280
But Pendulum doesn't only 
belong to you anymore!

00:13:24.790 --> 00:13:28.750
Eventually, someone else will 
be able to Pendulum Summon!

00:13:29.090 --> 00:13:31.820
My turn!  I draw!

00:13:32.690 --> 00:13:34.090
All right!

00:13:34.090 --> 00:13:36.340
Exchanging Notes?

00:13:36.340 --> 00:13:37.560
What's that?

00:13:37.790 --> 00:13:41.990
I activate the spell card Exchanging Notes!

00:13:41.990 --> 00:13:48.790
When Gutsmaster is on the field, I draw two cards 
from my deck and exchange them with two cards in your hand!

00:13:48.790 --> 00:13:49.740
What?

00:13:50.290 --> 00:13:54.940
I drew Gutsmaster Fire and Gutsmaster Heat.

00:13:56.040 --> 00:13:59.120
First, I give you these two cards!

00:14:00.590 --> 00:14:06.590
I exchange them for Stargazer 
Magician and Timegazer Magician!

00:14:07.840 --> 00:14:14.190
But I'm not allowed to summon or Special 
Summon these monsters this turn.

00:14:14.190 --> 00:14:18.940
Next, I activate the spell card Go Go Guts!

00:14:18.940 --> 00:14:24.390
When my Gutsmasters are in your 
hand, I can return them to my hand!

00:14:27.340 --> 00:14:32.340
When this effect adds monsters to my hand, 
I can't Normal Summon them this turn.

00:14:32.340 --> 00:14:36.040
However, they can be Pendulum Summoned!

00:14:36.380 --> 00:14:44.190
I set the Pendulum Scale with Scale 1 
Stargazer Magician and Scale 8 Timegazer Magician!

00:14:55.310 --> 00:14:59.890
Now I can summon monsters between 
Level 2 and 7 simultaneously!

00:15:01.750 --> 00:15:03.980
Pendulum Summon!

00:15:03.980 --> 00:15:08.990
Red blood boils to set my soul on fire!

00:15:08.990 --> 00:15:12.390
Gutsmaster Fire and Heat!

00:15:15.330 --> 00:15:19.390
What's wrong?  Are you shocked 
that someone like me can Pendulum?

00:15:19.390 --> 00:15:22.090
Yusyo Sakaki wasn't like that.

00:15:22.090 --> 00:15:26.470
Even when everyone was able to 
Action Duel, he kept smiling!

00:15:28.590 --> 00:15:29.610
Smiling?

00:15:29.840 --> 00:15:30.910
Yeah.

00:15:30.910 --> 00:15:33.790
And he honed his skills 
so that he wouldn't lose!

00:15:33.790 --> 00:15:40.920
He had friendly rivalries, which led to 
the prosperity of today's Action Duels!

00:15:42.240 --> 00:15:45.440
Of course I know your father.

00:15:45.440 --> 00:15:52.640
He's a pioneer who built up Action Duels into the 
success it experiences today, so I admire him deeply.

00:15:52.640 --> 00:15:54.840
He also said that.

00:15:56.400 --> 00:15:58.990
First class knows first class!

00:15:58.990 --> 00:16:01.390
Yuya, you have to become first class too!

00:16:02.570 --> 00:16:08.840
Since you're the first to open Pendulum's 
door, become the example for everyone to follow!

00:16:08.840 --> 00:16:11.890
Hone your skills so that you 
won't lose against Reiji Akaba!

00:16:16.040 --> 00:16:18.190
I end my turn!

00:16:18.740 --> 00:16:20.490
He's not going to attack?

00:16:20.490 --> 00:16:22.890
Like I said, he's socially awkward.

00:16:22.890 --> 00:16:24.290
I get it!

00:16:24.290 --> 00:16:26.870
He didn't have to Pendulum 
in the first place.

00:16:27.690 --> 00:16:30.970
He said he had something 
more important than winning.

00:16:30.970 --> 00:16:35.240
If it wasn't for that, he would've 
been more successful as a pro.

00:16:35.240 --> 00:16:37.640
Mrs. Sakaki, you're leaving?

00:16:37.940 --> 00:16:39.540
It's all fine now.

00:16:39.540 --> 00:16:41.640
I don't need to be here.

00:16:42.240 --> 00:16:48.990
The cards that Exchanging Notes exchanged 
return to the other's hand at the end of the turn!

00:16:52.190 --> 00:16:54.140
I see it.

00:16:54.140 --> 00:16:57.530
I see that Pendulum Summon 
can evolve even further.

00:16:57.690 --> 00:17:02.040
Reiji Akaba was trying to go beyond Pendulum.

00:17:02.040 --> 00:17:03.540
But I...

00:17:03.790 --> 00:17:07.490
If you get scared and cringe, 
you can't do anything.

00:17:07.490 --> 00:17:09.440
If you want to win...

00:17:09.890 --> 00:17:12.390
Then have courage and step forward!

00:17:13.440 --> 00:17:17.220
I can't see what's beyond Pendulum.

00:17:17.890 --> 00:17:20.490
However...  My turn!

00:17:20.790 --> 00:17:23.740
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:17:23.740 --> 00:17:29.440
It's time to see the real Yuya 
Sakaki-style entertainment duel!

00:17:29.440 --> 00:17:31.490
Come, Whip Snake!

00:17:34.240 --> 00:17:36.140
Woohoo!

00:17:40.590 --> 00:17:41.670
All right!

00:17:42.040 --> 00:17:45.830
I activate the Action Spell Illusion Dance!

00:17:58.820 --> 00:18:03.030
The principal used that card 
before to stop an attack!

00:18:03.030 --> 00:18:04.630
So why now?

00:18:04.630 --> 00:18:09.970
Because Gutsmasters' effects only activate 
when they're in attack position.

00:18:09.970 --> 00:18:12.910
If they're in defense position, 
they won't activate!

00:18:12.910 --> 00:18:15.670
But Whip Snake is also dancing.

00:18:22.110 --> 00:18:23.990
All right!  Perfect!

00:18:24.470 --> 00:18:29.190
Here's today's main event that 
you've all been waiting for!

00:18:29.190 --> 00:18:30.670
That guy...

00:18:30.670 --> 00:18:38.430
I set the Pendulum Scale with Scale 1 
Stargazer Magician and Scale 8 Timegazer Magician!

00:18:47.410 --> 00:18:52.110
Now I can summon monsters between 
Level 2 and 7 simultaneously!

00:18:52.110 --> 00:18:54.830
Swing, my soul's pendulum!

00:18:54.830 --> 00:18:57.520
Draw an arc of light in the sky!

00:18:57.520 --> 00:18:59.310
Pendulum Summon!

00:18:59.310 --> 00:19:01.910
Come out, my monsters!

00:19:04.790 --> 00:19:07.430
Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:19:08.460 --> 00:19:11.130
Performapal Spikeagle!

00:19:11.590 --> 00:19:14.670
And Performapal Stamp Turtle!

00:19:18.590 --> 00:19:24.830
I select Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon 
and activate Spikeagle's effect!

00:19:25.790 --> 00:19:31.950
When its attack points are greater than your monster's 
defense points, the difference is dealt to you as piercing damage.

00:19:32.710 --> 00:19:34.190
Piercing effect?

00:19:34.430 --> 00:19:38.190
Next, Stamp Turtle's effect activates!

00:19:38.190 --> 00:19:43.160
Once per turn, all monsters 
on the field gain 1 Level.

00:19:45.000 --> 00:19:51.790
Then I select Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon and 
activate the Action Spell Illusion Fire!

00:19:52.710 --> 00:20:00.680
Monsters that weren't selected can't attack, 
but Odd-Eyes can attack for each of those monsters!

00:20:00.910 --> 00:20:03.350
Odd-Eyes can attack three times?

00:20:04.350 --> 00:20:06.250
Battle, Odd-Eyes!

00:20:06.250 --> 00:20:08.650
Attack Gutsmaster Fire!

00:20:08.650 --> 00:20:11.110
Spiral Strike Burst!

00:20:21.910 --> 00:20:23.900
It's like a phoenix!

00:20:25.750 --> 00:20:30.830
Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon's 
effect now activates!

00:20:30.830 --> 00:20:35.790
When it destroys a Level 5-or-above 
monster, you take double the damage!

00:20:37.870 --> 00:20:41.220
Next, attack Gutsmaster Heat!

00:20:48.230 --> 00:20:49.900
Damage is doubled!

00:20:52.330 --> 00:20:54.000
This is the last one!

00:20:54.000 --> 00:20:57.070
Attack Gutsmaster Red!

00:21:03.880 --> 00:21:06.230
It also deals double the damage!

00:21:07.850 --> 00:21:09.950
I'm burning up!

00:21:09.950 --> 00:21:12.990
I'm burnt out!

00:21:20.530 --> 00:21:22.190
Principal!

00:21:22.790 --> 00:21:24.270
Principal!

00:21:24.270 --> 00:21:25.550
Pull yourself together!

00:21:25.550 --> 00:21:27.050
Are you okay?

00:21:27.050 --> 00:21:28.910
Well done, Yuya.

00:21:28.910 --> 00:21:33.590
I've told you everything 
I needed to tell you.

00:21:35.750 --> 00:21:38.030
Principal!

00:21:38.030 --> 00:21:40.690
Hot-Blooded Shuzo Theater
The End

00:21:43.190 --> 00:21:46.070
You don't get to end the episode!

00:21:46.070 --> 00:21:47.650
How touching!

00:21:49.450 --> 00:21:51.290
Thank you, Principal.

00:21:52.320 --> 00:21:55.340
I'll train harder than anyone!

00:21:55.340 --> 00:22:02.630
I'll become better and stronger so that I can 
become a duelist like my dad and make everyone smile!

00:22:02.630 --> 00:22:03.940
Yuya...

00:22:12.960 --> 00:22:18.440
Catch the dream dancing in my heart
Release my falling tears

00:22:18.660 --> 00:22:27.920
I'll step out on to my first field
To meet my miracle  Fabulous One Step

00:22:34.810 --> 00:22:39.930
I realized that strength can't be given

00:22:40.190 --> 00:22:45.170
It's something I have to grab myself

00:22:45.460 --> 00:22:50.610
In that case, I have to keep moving
I can't stay still

00:22:50.860 --> 00:22:55.870
Even if walls and headwinds block my way

00:22:56.070 --> 00:23:01.470
I'll draw my trump card called 
"courage" to take a step forward

00:23:01.470 --> 00:23:05.890
I believe in my story of victory

00:23:06.180 --> 00:23:11.860
Everyone during battle is My Way
Duelists are being tested

00:23:11.860 --> 00:23:17.270
When times are tough, that's when you 
Smile, Jump, Fight & Step Up!

00:23:17.270 --> 00:23:22.570
Your smile is your Energy
Kick away your feelings of running away

00:23:22.570 --> 00:23:31.940
Jump into the new field
Shiny One Step that leads to the future

00:23:32.940 --> 00:23:40.160
One step... Just one step is fine
That's your Big Chance!!

00:23:45.190 --> 00:23:47.100
I'm gonna do it!

00:23:47.100 --> 00:23:53.030
I'll train more so that I can become a pro 
entertainment duelist like my dad and make everyone smile!

00:23:53.030 --> 00:23:56.050
To become a pro, you have to win 
the Junior Youth Championship.

00:23:56.300 --> 00:23:57.990
And win the Youth Championship!

00:23:57.990 --> 00:24:00.270
And pass the pro test!

00:24:00.270 --> 00:24:04.960
Oh yeah...  That means I can't become a pro!

00:24:04.960 --> 00:24:06.730
Whaaaaaaat?

00:24:06.730 --> 00:24:11.160
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V:
Go for the Junior Youth Championship!!

00:24:11.160 --> 00:24:13.410
The fun is only getting started!
